{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden","slug":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden","title":"The Keeper of the Stone Garden","title_ko":"돌 정원지기","level":"B1","ageBand":"11-13","coverUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/cover.webp","summary_ko":"돌만 가득한 정원을 가꾸는 노인에게서 아이가 기다림과 정성의 의미를 배우는 이야기.","wordCount":290,"pages":[{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p1","pageNo":1,"spread":"p1","imageUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/p1.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p1-s1","ord":0,"text":"Beyond the old village wall stood a quiet garden.","translation_ko":"낡은 마을 담장 너머에 고요한 정원이 있었습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p1-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Beyond","charStart":0,"charEnd":6,"startMs":0,"endMs":600},{"word":"the","charStart":7,"charEnd":10,"startMs":600,"endMs":860},{"word":"old","charStart":11,"charEnd":14,"startMs":860,"endMs":1280},{"word":"village","charStart":15,"charEnd":22,"startMs":1280,"endMs":1500},{"word":"wall","charStart":23,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1500,"endMs":1880},{"word":"stood","charStart":28,"charEnd":33,"startMs":1880,"endMs":2520},{"word":"a","charStart":34,"charEnd":35,"startMs":2520,"endMs":3140},{"word":"quiet","charStart":36,"charEnd":41,"startMs":3140,"endMs":3140},{"word":"garden","charStart":42,"charEnd":48,"startMs":3140,"endMs":3400}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p1-s2","ord":1,"text":"It held no flowers, only grey and mossy stones.","translation_ko":"그곳에는 꽃 한 송이 없고 이끼 낀 회색 돌들만 가득했습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p1-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"It","charStart":0,"charEnd":2,"startMs":0,"endMs":240},{"word":"held","charStart":3,"charEnd":7,"startMs":240,"endMs":560},{"word":"no","charStart":8,"charEnd":10,"startMs":560,"endMs":1040},{"word":"flowers","charStart":11,"charEnd":18,"startMs":1040,"endMs":1560},{"word":"only","charStart":20,"charEnd":24,"startMs":2100,"endMs":2400},{"word":"grey","charStart":25,"charEnd":29,"startMs":2400,"endMs":2860},{"word":"and","charStart":30,"charEnd":33,"startMs":2860,"endMs":3400},{"word":"mossy","charStart":34,"charEnd":39,"startMs":3400,"endMs":3860},{"word":"stones","charStart":40,"charEnd":46,"startMs":3860,"endMs":4180}]}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p2","pageNo":2,"spread":"p2","imageUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/p2.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p2-s1","ord":0,"text":"A curious child named Mia peeked through the gate.","translation_ko":"미아라는 호기심 많은 아이가 문 사이로 살짝 들여다보았습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p2-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"A","charStart":0,"charEnd":1,"startMs":0,"endMs":200},{"word":"curious","charStart":2,"charEnd":9,"startMs":200,"endMs":720},{"word":"child","charStart":10,"charEnd":15,"startMs":720,"endMs":1100},{"word":"named","charStart":16,"charEnd":21,"startMs":1100,"endMs":1380},{"word":"Mia","charStart":22,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1380,"endMs":1720},{"word":"peeked","charStart":26,"charEnd":32,"startMs":1720,"endMs":2460},{"word":"through","charStart":33,"charEnd":40,"startMs":2460,"endMs":2560},{"word":"the","charStart":41,"charEnd":44,"startMs":2560,"endMs":2680},{"word":"gate","charStart":45,"charEnd":49,"startMs":2680,"endMs":2940}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p2-s2","ord":1,"text":"She saw an old man kneeling beside the largest stone.","translation_ko":"그녀는 한 노인이 가장 큰 돌 곁에 무릎을 꿇고 있는 것을 보았습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p2-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"She","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":380},{"word":"saw","charStart":4,"charEnd":7,"startMs":380,"endMs":700},{"word":"an","charStart":8,"charEnd":10,"startMs":700,"endMs":980},{"word":"old","charStart":11,"charEnd":14,"startMs":980,"endMs":1340},{"word":"man","charStart":15,"charEnd":18,"startMs":1340,"endMs":1640},{"word":"kneeling","charStart":19,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1640,"endMs":2020},{"word":"beside","charStart":28,"charEnd":34,"startMs":2020,"endMs":2380},{"word":"the","charStart":35,"charEnd":38,"startMs":2380,"endMs":2620},{"word":"largest","charStart":39,"charEnd":46,"startMs":2620,"endMs":2960},{"word":"stone","charStart":47,"charEnd":52,"startMs":2960,"endMs":3300}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p2-s3","ord":2,"text":"His white hair caught the morning light.","translation_ko":"그의 흰 머리카락이 아침 햇살에 빛났습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p2-s3.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"His","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":240},{"word":"white","charStart":4,"charEnd":9,"startMs":240,"endMs":680},{"word":"hair","charStart":10,"charEnd":14,"startMs":680,"endMs":1200},{"word":"caught","charStart":15,"charEnd":21,"startMs":1200,"endMs":1780},{"word":"the","charStart":22,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1780,"endMs":2180},{"word":"morning","charStart":26,"charEnd":33,"startMs":2180,"endMs":2440},{"word":"light","charStart":34,"charEnd":39,"startMs":2440,"endMs":2840}]}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p3","pageNo":3,"spread":"p3","imageUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/p3.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p3-s1","ord":0,"text":"The old keeper held a bamboo rake and smiled.","translation_ko":"노인은 대나무 갈퀴를 들고 미소를 지었습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p3-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"The","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":240},{"word":"old","charStart":4,"charEnd":7,"startMs":240,"endMs":660},{"word":"keeper","charStart":8,"charEnd":14,"startMs":660,"endMs":1020},{"word":"held","charStart":15,"charEnd":19,"startMs":1020,"endMs":1360},{"word":"a","charStart":20,"charEnd":21,"startMs":1360,"endMs":1740},{"word":"bamboo","charStart":22,"charEnd":28,"startMs":1740,"endMs":1960},{"word":"rake","charStart":29,"charEnd":33,"startMs":1960,"endMs":2260},{"word":"and","charStart":34,"charEnd":37,"startMs":2260,"endMs":2720},{"word":"smiled","charStart":38,"charEnd":44,"startMs":2720,"endMs":3060}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p3-s2","ord":1,"text":"He drew slow, careful lines across the pale gravel.","translation_ko":"그는 옅은 자갈 위에 천천히 조심스럽게 선을 그었습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p3-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"He","charStart":0,"charEnd":2,"startMs":0,"endMs":200},{"word":"drew","charStart":3,"charEnd":7,"startMs":200,"endMs":420},{"word":"slow","charStart":8,"charEnd":12,"startMs":420,"endMs":980},{"word":"careful","charStart":14,"charEnd":21,"startMs":1460,"endMs":1460},{"word":"lines","charStart":22,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1460,"endMs":1880},{"word":"across","charStart":28,"charEnd":34,"startMs":1880,"endMs":2260},{"word":"the","charStart":35,"charEnd":38,"startMs":2260,"endMs":2680},{"word":"pale","charStart":39,"charEnd":43,"startMs":2680,"endMs":2780},{"word":"gravel","charStart":44,"charEnd":50,"startMs":2780,"endMs":3120}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p3-s3","ord":2,"text":"Every line followed the curve of the stone beside it.","translation_ko":"모든 선은 그 옆 돌의 곡선을 따라 흘렀습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p3-s3.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Every","charStart":0,"charEnd":5,"startMs":0,"endMs":420},{"word":"line","charStart":6,"charEnd":10,"startMs":420,"endMs":800},{"word":"followed","charStart":11,"charEnd":19,"startMs":800,"endMs":1120},{"word":"the","charStart":20,"charEnd":23,"startMs":1120,"endMs":1400},{"word":"curve","charStart":24,"charEnd":29,"startMs":1400,"endMs":1560},{"word":"of","charStart":30,"charEnd":32,"startMs":1560,"endMs":1720},{"word":"the","charStart":33,"charEnd":36,"startMs":1720,"endMs":1980},{"word":"stone","charStart":37,"charEnd":42,"startMs":1980,"endMs":2140},{"word":"beside","charStart":43,"charEnd":49,"startMs":2140,"endMs":2600},{"word":"it","charStart":50,"charEnd":52,"startMs":2600,"endMs":2800}]}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p4","pageNo":4,"spread":"p4","imageUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/p4.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p4-s1","ord":0,"text":"Mia frowned and whispered, This place is so dull.","translation_ko":"미아는 눈살을 찌푸리며 중얼거렸습니다. '이곳은 정말 지루해.'","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p4-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Mia","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":380},{"word":"frowned","charStart":4,"charEnd":11,"startMs":380,"endMs":900},{"word":"and","charStart":12,"charEnd":15,"startMs":900,"endMs":1280},{"word":"whispered","charStart":16,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1280,"endMs":1740},{"word":"This","charStart":27,"charEnd":31,"startMs":2120,"endMs":2440},{"word":"place","charStart":32,"charEnd":37,"startMs":2440,"endMs":2800},{"word":"is","charStart":38,"charEnd":40,"startMs":2800,"endMs":3120},{"word":"so","charStart":41,"charEnd":43,"startMs":3120,"endMs":3440},{"word":"dull","charStart":44,"charEnd":48,"startMs":3440,"endMs":3880}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p4-s2","ord":1,"text":"The keeper heard her and beckoned her inside.","translation_ko":"노인은 그 말을 듣고 손짓으로 그녀를 안으로 불렀습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p4-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"The","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":220},{"word":"keeper","charStart":4,"charEnd":10,"startMs":220,"endMs":540},{"word":"heard","charStart":11,"charEnd":16,"startMs":540,"endMs":760},{"word":"her","charStart":17,"charEnd":20,"startMs":760,"endMs":980},{"word":"and","charStart":21,"charEnd":24,"startMs":980,"endMs":1460},{"word":"beckoned","charStart":25,"charEnd":33,"startMs":1460,"endMs":1700},{"word":"her","charStart":34,"charEnd":37,"startMs":1700,"endMs":1880},{"word":"inside","charStart":38,"charEnd":44,"startMs":1880,"endMs":2340}]}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p5","pageNo":5,"spread":"p5","imageUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/p5.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p5-s1","ord":0,"text":"He handed her the rake and guided her hand gently.","translation_ko":"노인은 그녀에게 갈퀴를 건네며 손을 부드럽게 이끌어 주었습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p5-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"He","charStart":0,"charEnd":2,"startMs":0,"endMs":280},{"word":"handed","charStart":3,"charEnd":9,"startMs":280,"endMs":540},{"word":"her","charStart":10,"charEnd":13,"startMs":540,"endMs":740},{"word":"the","charStart":14,"charEnd":17,"startMs":740,"endMs":1300},{"word":"rake","charStart":18,"charEnd":22,"startMs":1300,"endMs":1400},{"word":"and","charStart":23,"charEnd":26,"startMs":1400,"endMs":1720},{"word":"guided","charStart":27,"charEnd":33,"startMs":1720,"endMs":1980},{"word":"her","charStart":34,"charEnd":37,"startMs":1980,"endMs":2240},{"word":"hand","charStart":38,"charEnd":42,"startMs":2240,"endMs":2620},{"word":"gently","charStart":43,"charEnd":49,"startMs":2620,"endMs":3040}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p5-s2","ord":1,"text":"The gravel shifted with a soft, satisfying sound.","translation_ko":"자갈이 부드럽고 기분 좋은 소리를 내며 흘러내렸습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p5-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"The","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":180},{"word":"gravel","charStart":4,"charEnd":10,"startMs":180,"endMs":520},{"word":"shifted","charStart":11,"charEnd":18,"startMs":520,"endMs":920},{"word":"with","charStart":19,"charEnd":23,"startMs":920,"endMs":1180},{"word":"a","charStart":24,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1180,"endMs":1420},{"word":"soft","charStart":26,"charEnd":30,"startMs":1420,"endMs":1760},{"word":"satisfying","charStart":32,"charEnd":42,"startMs":2400,"endMs":2400},{"word":"sound","charStart":43,"charEnd":48,"startMs":2400,"endMs":2820}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p5-s3","ord":2,"text":"Mia felt something change inside her chest.","translation_ko":"미아는 가슴속에서 무언가가 달라지는 것을 느꼈습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p5-s3.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Mia","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":340},{"word":"felt","charStart":4,"charEnd":8,"startMs":340,"endMs":660},{"word":"something","charStart":9,"charEnd":18,"startMs":660,"endMs":1000},{"word":"change","charStart":19,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1000,"endMs":1500},{"word":"inside","charStart":26,"charEnd":32,"startMs":1500,"endMs":1880},{"word":"her","charStart":33,"charEnd":36,"startMs":1880,"endMs":2080},{"word":"chest","charStart":37,"charEnd":42,"startMs":2080,"endMs":2360}]}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p6","pageNo":6,"spread":"p6","imageUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/p6.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p6-s1","ord":0,"text":"She returned the next morning and the morning after that.","translation_ko":"그녀는 다음 날 아침에도, 그다음 날 아침에도 다시 찾아왔습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p6-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"She","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":280},{"word":"returned","charStart":4,"charEnd":12,"startMs":280,"endMs":720},{"word":"the","charStart":13,"charEnd":16,"startMs":720,"endMs":920},{"word":"next","charStart":17,"charEnd":21,"startMs":920,"endMs":1240},{"word":"morning","charStart":22,"charEnd":29,"startMs":1240,"endMs":1580},{"word":"and","charStart":30,"charEnd":33,"startMs":2020,"endMs":2100},{"word":"the","charStart":34,"charEnd":37,"startMs":2100,"endMs":2260},{"word":"morning","charStart":38,"charEnd":45,"startMs":2260,"endMs":2480},{"word":"after","charStart":46,"charEnd":51,"startMs":2480,"endMs":2780},{"word":"that","charStart":52,"charEnd":56,"startMs":2780,"endMs":3060}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p6-s2","ord":1,"text":"The keeper taught her the name of every stone.","translation_ko":"노인은 그녀에게 돌 하나하나의 이름을 가르쳐 주었습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p6-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"The","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":760},{"word":"keeper","charStart":4,"charEnd":10,"startMs":760,"endMs":960},{"word":"taught","charStart":11,"charEnd":17,"startMs":960,"endMs":1320},{"word":"her","charStart":18,"charEnd":21,"startMs":1320,"endMs":1480},{"word":"the","charStart":22,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1480,"endMs":1660},{"word":"name","charStart":26,"charEnd":30,"startMs":1660,"endMs":1860},{"word":"of","charStart":31,"charEnd":33,"startMs":1860,"endMs":2060},{"word":"every","charStart":34,"charEnd":39,"startMs":2060,"endMs":2400},{"word":"stone","charStart":40,"charEnd":45,"startMs":2400,"endMs":2720}]}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p7","pageNo":7,"spread":"p7","imageUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/p7.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p7-s1","ord":0,"text":"Autumn arrived and the moss turned a deeper green.","translation_ko":"가을이 찾아오자 이끼는 더욱 짙은 초록빛으로 물들었습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p7-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Autumn","charStart":0,"charEnd":6,"startMs":0,"endMs":360},{"word":"arrived","charStart":7,"charEnd":14,"startMs":360,"endMs":1020},{"word":"and","charStart":15,"charEnd":18,"startMs":1440,"endMs":1460},{"word":"the","charStart":19,"charEnd":22,"startMs":1460,"endMs":1680},{"word":"moss","charStart":23,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1680,"endMs":1940},{"word":"turned","charStart":28,"charEnd":34,"startMs":1940,"endMs":2280},{"word":"a","charStart":35,"charEnd":36,"startMs":2280,"endMs":2740},{"word":"deeper","charStart":37,"charEnd":43,"startMs":2740,"endMs":2740},{"word":"green","charStart":44,"charEnd":49,"startMs":2740,"endMs":3100}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p7-s2","ord":1,"text":"Mia had not noticed that colour before.","translation_ko":"미아는 예전에 그 색깔을 전혀 알아채지 못했었습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p7-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Mia","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":400},{"word":"had","charStart":4,"charEnd":7,"startMs":400,"endMs":800},{"word":"not","charStart":8,"charEnd":11,"startMs":800,"endMs":1060},{"word":"noticed","charStart":12,"charEnd":19,"startMs":1060,"endMs":1340},{"word":"that","charStart":20,"charEnd":24,"startMs":1340,"endMs":1600},{"word":"colour","charStart":25,"charEnd":31,"startMs":1600,"endMs":1840},{"word":"before","charStart":32,"charEnd":38,"startMs":1840,"endMs":2240}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p7-s3","ord":2,"text":"She pressed her fingers against the cool, velvet surface.","translation_ko":"그녀는 차갑고 부드러운 이끼 표면에 손가락을 살며시 대어 보았습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p7-s3.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"She","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":460},{"word":"pressed","charStart":4,"charEnd":11,"startMs":460,"endMs":760},{"word":"her","charStart":12,"charEnd":15,"startMs":760,"endMs":1040},{"word":"fingers","charStart":16,"charEnd":23,"startMs":1040,"endMs":1440},{"word":"against","charStart":24,"charEnd":31,"startMs":1440,"endMs":1820},{"word":"the","charStart":32,"charEnd":35,"startMs":1820,"endMs":2100},{"word":"cool","charStart":36,"charEnd":40,"startMs":2100,"endMs":2740},{"word":"velvet","charStart":42,"charEnd":48,"startMs":3040,"endMs":3140},{"word":"surface","charStart":49,"charEnd":56,"startMs":3140,"endMs":3680}]}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p8","pageNo":8,"spread":"p8","imageUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/p8.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p8-s1","ord":0,"text":"Winter brought frost that outlined every stone in white.","translation_ko":"겨울이 오자 서리가 돌마다 하얀 윤곽을 그려 주었습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p8-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Winter","charStart":0,"charEnd":6,"startMs":0,"endMs":460},{"word":"brought","charStart":7,"charEnd":14,"startMs":460,"endMs":840},{"word":"frost","charStart":15,"charEnd":20,"startMs":840,"endMs":1300},{"word":"that","charStart":21,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1300,"endMs":1640},{"word":"outlined","charStart":26,"charEnd":34,"startMs":1640,"endMs":1960},{"word":"every","charStart":35,"charEnd":40,"startMs":1960,"endMs":2480},{"word":"stone","charStart":41,"charEnd":46,"startMs":2480,"endMs":2780},{"word":"in","charStart":47,"charEnd":49,"startMs":2780,"endMs":3120},{"word":"white","charStart":50,"charEnd":55,"startMs":3120,"endMs":3320}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p8-s2","ord":1,"text":"The garden looked like a painting no one had planned.","translation_ko":"정원은 누구도 계획하지 않은 그림처럼 보였습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p8-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"The","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":240},{"word":"garden","charStart":4,"charEnd":10,"startMs":240,"endMs":520},{"word":"looked","charStart":11,"charEnd":17,"startMs":520,"endMs":900},{"word":"like","charStart":18,"charEnd":22,"startMs":900,"endMs":1140},{"word":"a","charStart":23,"charEnd":24,"startMs":1140,"endMs":1340},{"word":"painting","charStart":25,"charEnd":33,"startMs":1340,"endMs":1660},{"word":"no","charStart":34,"charEnd":36,"startMs":1660,"endMs":2020},{"word":"one","charStart":37,"charEnd":40,"startMs":2020,"endMs":2220},{"word":"had","charStart":41,"charEnd":44,"startMs":2220,"endMs":2460},{"word":"planned","charStart":45,"charEnd":52,"startMs":2460,"endMs":2780}]}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p9","pageNo":9,"spread":"p9","imageUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/p9.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p9-s1","ord":0,"text":"By spring, Mia woke before sunrise to be there first.","translation_ko":"봄이 되자 미아는 제일 먼저 도착하려고 해 뜨기 전에 일어났습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p9-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"By","charStart":0,"charEnd":2,"startMs":0,"endMs":460},{"word":"spring","charStart":3,"charEnd":9,"startMs":460,"endMs":1120},{"word":"Mia","charStart":11,"charEnd":14,"startMs":1640,"endMs":1740},{"word":"woke","charStart":15,"charEnd":19,"startMs":1740,"endMs":2060},{"word":"before","charStart":20,"charEnd":26,"startMs":2060,"endMs":2500},{"word":"sunrise","charStart":27,"charEnd":34,"startMs":2500,"endMs":3020},{"word":"to","charStart":35,"charEnd":37,"startMs":3020,"endMs":3240},{"word":"be","charStart":38,"charEnd":40,"startMs":3240,"endMs":3400},{"word":"there","charStart":41,"charEnd":46,"startMs":3400,"endMs":3620},{"word":"first","charStart":47,"charEnd":52,"startMs":3620,"endMs":3980}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p9-s2","ord":1,"text":"She raked her own pattern across the gravel with care.","translation_ko":"그녀는 정성껏 자갈 위에 자신만의 무늬를 그었습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p9-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"She","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":340},{"word":"raked","charStart":4,"charEnd":9,"startMs":340,"endMs":620},{"word":"her","charStart":10,"charEnd":13,"startMs":620,"endMs":820},{"word":"own","charStart":14,"charEnd":17,"startMs":820,"endMs":1240},{"word":"pattern","charStart":18,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1240,"endMs":1560},{"word":"across","charStart":26,"charEnd":32,"startMs":1560,"endMs":2100},{"word":"the","charStart":33,"charEnd":36,"startMs":2100,"endMs":2360},{"word":"gravel","charStart":37,"charEnd":43,"startMs":2360,"endMs":2680},{"word":"with","charStart":44,"charEnd":48,"startMs":2680,"endMs":3140},{"word":"care","charStart":49,"charEnd":53,"startMs":3140,"endMs":3500}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p9-s3","ord":2,"text":"The keeper watched from the gate and nodded slowly.","translation_ko":"노인은 문 앞에서 바라보며 천천히 고개를 끄덕였습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p9-s3.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"The","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":220},{"word":"keeper","charStart":4,"charEnd":10,"startMs":220,"endMs":520},{"word":"watched","charStart":11,"charEnd":18,"startMs":520,"endMs":920},{"word":"from","charStart":19,"charEnd":23,"startMs":920,"endMs":1140},{"word":"the","charStart":24,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1140,"endMs":1460},{"word":"gate","charStart":28,"charEnd":32,"startMs":1460,"endMs":1520},{"word":"and","charStart":33,"charEnd":36,"startMs":1520,"endMs":2200},{"word":"nodded","charStart":37,"charEnd":43,"startMs":2200,"endMs":2580},{"word":"slowly","charStart":44,"charEnd":50,"startMs":2580,"endMs":2960}]}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p10","pageNo":10,"spread":"p10","imageUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/p10.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p10-s1","ord":0,"text":"One summer afternoon the keeper sat under the old pine.","translation_ko":"어느 여름 오후, 노인은 오래된 소나무 아래 앉았습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p10-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"One","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":420},{"word":"summer","charStart":4,"charEnd":10,"startMs":420,"endMs":700},{"word":"afternoon","charStart":11,"charEnd":20,"startMs":700,"endMs":1220},{"word":"the","charStart":21,"charEnd":24,"startMs":1340,"endMs":1500},{"word":"keeper","charStart":25,"charEnd":31,"startMs":1500,"endMs":1660},{"word":"sat","charStart":32,"charEnd":35,"startMs":1660,"endMs":2040},{"word":"under","charStart":36,"charEnd":41,"startMs":2040,"endMs":2240},{"word":"the","charStart":42,"charEnd":45,"startMs":2240,"endMs":2440},{"word":"old","charStart":46,"charEnd":49,"startMs":2440,"endMs":2660},{"word":"pine","charStart":50,"charEnd":54,"startMs":2660,"endMs":2900}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p10-s2","ord":1,"text":"He said, You have learned what stones cannot teach alone.","translation_ko":"그는 말했습니다. '넌 돌만으로는 배울 수 없는 것을 배웠구나.'","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p10-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"He","charStart":0,"charEnd":2,"startMs":0,"endMs":280},{"word":"said","charStart":3,"charEnd":7,"startMs":280,"endMs":580},{"word":"You","charStart":9,"charEnd":12,"startMs":840,"endMs":1260},{"word":"have","charStart":13,"charEnd":17,"startMs":1260,"endMs":1480},{"word":"learned","charStart":18,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1480,"endMs":1780},{"word":"what","charStart":26,"charEnd":30,"startMs":1780,"endMs":2080},{"word":"stones","charStart":31,"charEnd":37,"startMs":2080,"endMs":2340},{"word":"cannot","charStart":38,"charEnd":44,"startMs":2340,"endMs":2740},{"word":"teach","charStart":45,"charEnd":50,"startMs":2740,"endMs":3060},{"word":"alone","charStart":51,"charEnd":56,"startMs":3060,"endMs":3420}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p10-s3","ord":2,"text":"Mia understood that patience was the real lesson.","translation_ko":"미아는 기다림 자체가 진짜 교훈임을 깨달았습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p10-s3.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Mia","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":340},{"word":"understood","charStart":4,"charEnd":14,"startMs":340,"endMs":900},{"word":"that","charStart":15,"charEnd":19,"startMs":900,"endMs":1200},{"word":"patience","charStart":20,"charEnd":28,"startMs":1200,"endMs":1700},{"word":"was","charStart":29,"charEnd":32,"startMs":1700,"endMs":1860},{"word":"the","charStart":33,"charEnd":36,"startMs":1860,"endMs":2020},{"word":"real","charStart":37,"charEnd":41,"startMs":2020,"endMs":2300},{"word":"lesson","charStart":42,"charEnd":48,"startMs":2300,"endMs":2600}]}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p11","pageNo":11,"spread":"p11","imageUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/p11.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p11-s1","ord":0,"text":"Years later the keeper grew too old to kneel.","translation_ko":"몇 년이 흐른 뒤 노인은 무릎을 꿇기에는 너무 늙어 버렸습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p11-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Years","charStart":0,"charEnd":5,"startMs":0,"endMs":380},{"word":"later","charStart":6,"charEnd":11,"startMs":380,"endMs":820},{"word":"the","charStart":12,"charEnd":15,"startMs":1100,"endMs":1300},{"word":"keeper","charStart":16,"charEnd":22,"startMs":1300,"endMs":1500},{"word":"grew","charStart":23,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1500,"endMs":1780},{"word":"too","charStart":28,"charEnd":31,"startMs":1780,"endMs":2120},{"word":"old","charStart":32,"charEnd":35,"startMs":2120,"endMs":2340},{"word":"to","charStart":36,"charEnd":38,"startMs":2340,"endMs":2700},{"word":"kneel","charStart":39,"charEnd":44,"startMs":2700,"endMs":2760}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p11-s2","ord":1,"text":"He placed the bamboo rake into Mia's hands.","translation_ko":"그는 대나무 갈퀴를 미아의 손에 쥐어 주었습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p11-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"He","charStart":0,"charEnd":2,"startMs":0,"endMs":220},{"word":"placed","charStart":3,"charEnd":9,"startMs":220,"endMs":580},{"word":"the","charStart":10,"charEnd":13,"startMs":580,"endMs":1020},{"word":"bamboo","charStart":14,"charEnd":20,"startMs":1020,"endMs":1260},{"word":"rake","charStart":21,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1260,"endMs":1560},{"word":"into","charStart":26,"charEnd":30,"startMs":1560,"endMs":1820},{"word":"Mia's","charStart":31,"charEnd":36,"startMs":1820,"endMs":2260},{"word":"hands","charStart":37,"charEnd":42,"startMs":2260,"endMs":2520}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p11-s3","ord":2,"text":"She held it the same careful way he always had.","translation_ko":"그녀는 노인이 늘 그랬던 것처럼 갈퀴를 조심스럽게 쥐었습니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p11-s3.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"She","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":760},{"word":"held","charStart":4,"charEnd":8,"startMs":760,"endMs":1020},{"word":"it","charStart":9,"charEnd":11,"startMs":1020,"endMs":1220},{"word":"the","charStart":12,"charEnd":15,"startMs":1220,"endMs":1360},{"word":"same","charStart":16,"charEnd":20,"startMs":1360,"endMs":1740},{"word":"careful","charStart":21,"charEnd":28,"startMs":1740,"endMs":2140},{"word":"way","charStart":29,"charEnd":32,"startMs":2140,"endMs":2400},{"word":"he","charStart":33,"charEnd":35,"startMs":2400,"endMs":2700},{"word":"always","charStart":36,"charEnd":42,"startMs":2700,"endMs":3080},{"word":"had","charStart":43,"charEnd":46,"startMs":3080,"endMs":3380}]}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p12","pageNo":12,"spread":"p12","imageUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/p12.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p12-s1","ord":0,"text":"Now Mia tends the garden each morning with quiet joy.","translation_ko":"이제 미아는 매일 아침 잔잔한 기쁨으로 정원을 가꿉니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p12-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Now","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":320},{"word":"Mia","charStart":4,"charEnd":7,"startMs":320,"endMs":660},{"word":"tends","charStart":8,"charEnd":13,"startMs":660,"endMs":1020},{"word":"the","charStart":14,"charEnd":17,"startMs":1020,"endMs":1240},{"word":"garden","charStart":18,"charEnd":24,"startMs":1240,"endMs":1500},{"word":"each","charStart":25,"charEnd":29,"startMs":1500,"endMs":1860},{"word":"morning","charStart":30,"charEnd":37,"startMs":1860,"endMs":2220},{"word":"with","charStart":38,"charEnd":42,"startMs":2220,"endMs":2480},{"word":"quiet","charStart":43,"charEnd":48,"startMs":2480,"endMs":2900},{"word":"joy","charStart":49,"charEnd":52,"startMs":2900,"endMs":3280}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p12-s2","ord":1,"text":"Children press their faces against the gate and wonder.","translation_ko":"아이들이 문에 얼굴을 붙이고 신기한 듯 바라봅니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p12-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Children","charStart":0,"charEnd":8,"startMs":0,"endMs":480},{"word":"press","charStart":9,"charEnd":14,"startMs":480,"endMs":860},{"word":"their","charStart":15,"charEnd":20,"startMs":860,"endMs":1080},{"word":"faces","charStart":21,"charEnd":26,"startMs":1080,"endMs":1460},{"word":"against","charStart":27,"charEnd":34,"startMs":1460,"endMs":1780},{"word":"the","charStart":35,"charEnd":38,"startMs":1780,"endMs":2000},{"word":"gate","charStart":39,"charEnd":43,"startMs":2000,"endMs":2220},{"word":"and","charStart":44,"charEnd":47,"startMs":2220,"endMs":2700},{"word":"wonder","charStart":48,"charEnd":54,"startMs":2700,"endMs":2960}]},{"id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-p12-s3","ord":2,"text":"She smiles and waits for one of them to ask.","translation_ko":"그녀는 미소를 지으며 그중 누군가가 물어오기를 기다립니다.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden/audio/p12-s3.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"She","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":280},{"word":"smiles","charStart":4,"charEnd":10,"startMs":280,"endMs":760},{"word":"and","charStart":11,"charEnd":14,"startMs":760,"endMs":1100},{"word":"waits","charStart":15,"charEnd":20,"startMs":1100,"endMs":1280},{"word":"for","charStart":21,"charEnd":24,"startMs":1280,"endMs":1600},{"word":"one","charStart":25,"charEnd":28,"startMs":1600,"endMs":1740},{"word":"of","charStart":29,"charEnd":31,"startMs":1740,"endMs":1900},{"word":"them","charStart":32,"charEnd":36,"startMs":1900,"endMs":1980},{"word":"to","charStart":37,"charEnd":39,"startMs":1980,"endMs":2420},{"word":"ask","charStart":40,"charEnd":43,"startMs":2420,"endMs":2560}]}]}],"quiz":[{"question_ko":"미아가 처음 정원을 보았을 때 어떻게 생각했나요?","type":"mc","options":["정원이 너무 아름답다고 생각했다.","정원이 지루하고 볼 것이 없다고 생각했다.","정원에 꽃을 심고 싶다고 생각했다.","정원이 너무 커서 무섭다고 생각했다."],"answerIndex":1,"explain_ko":"미아는 처음에 '이곳은 정말 지루해'라고 속삭였습니다. 꽃도 없이 돌만 있는 정원이 재미없어 보였던 것입니다.","id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-q1","ord":0},{"question_ko":"노인이 갈퀴로 자갈 위에 선을 그을 때, 그 선들은 어떤 모양을 따랐나요?","type":"mc","options":["나무의 가지 모양을 따랐다.","햇빛이 비치는 방향을 따랐다.","곁에 있는 돌의 곡선을 따랐다.","미아가 알려준 무늬를 따랐다."],"answerIndex":2,"explain_ko":"이야기에서 '모든 선은 그 옆 돌의 곡선을 따라 흘렀습니다'라고 나와 있습니다.","id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-q2","ord":1},{"question_ko":"가을이 되었을 때 정원에서 달라진 것은 무엇인가요?","type":"mc","options":["자갈이 모두 사라졌다.","꽃들이 활짝 피어났다.","이끼가 더욱 짙은 초록빛으로 변했다.","노인이 정원을 떠났다."],"answerIndex":2,"explain_ko":"가을이 오자 이끼가 더욱 짙은 초록빛으로 물들었고, 미아는 예전에는 그 색깔을 전혀 알아채지 못했었습니다.","id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-q3","ord":2},{"question_ko":"노인이 미아에게 '돌만으로는 배울 수 없는 것을 배웠다'고 말한 것은 무엇을 의미하나요?","type":"mc","options":["돌을 쌓는 기술을 배웠다는 뜻이다.","기다림과 정성이 진짜 교훈이라는 뜻이다.","정원 이름을 모두 외웠다는 뜻이다.","겨울 서리의 아름다움을 알게 되었다는 뜻이다."],"answerIndex":1,"explain_ko":"미아는 계절이 바뀌는 동안 정원을 가꾸며 기다림 자체가 진짜 교훈임을 깨달았습니다.","id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-q4","ord":3},{"question_ko":"이야기의 끝에서 미아는 왜 미소를 지으며 기다리나요?","type":"mc","options":["정원 일이 끝나서 쉬려고 기다린다.","노인이 돌아오기를 기다린다.","문 앞의 아이들 중 누군가가 정원에 관심을 가지길 기다린다.","계절이 바뀌기를 기다린다."],"answerIndex":2,"explain_ko":"미아는 자신이 어린 시절 노인에게 이끌렸던 것처럼, 문 밖의 아이들 중 누군가가 먼저 물어오기를 기다리고 있습니다.","id":"the-keeper-of-the-stone-garden-q5","ord":4}]}